    "body": "Thanks, but that would be more effort than just letting the config files get changed and then reverting them with a git checkout.\r\n\r\nIdeally, there would be some sort of profiles options, where different configurations could be chosen depending on what I want to do. For example, I actually have a simple single-line prompt with a few modules enabled as well as a background jobs indication, but my prompt looks pretty much like the default (coloured) Debian prompt in normal use.\r\n\r\nBut sometimes I would like to have more information in the prompts with two lines, but I really don't want more than one line in everyday use.",
